busy_roads_note.quote:
Note: Under SEPP (Transport and Infrastructure) 2021, busy roads include: 
 - M1 Motorway;
 - North Connex;
 - Pacific Highway; 
 - Ryde Road;
 - Mona Vale Road; 
 - Main Road 328, Section of Boundary Street, between Pacific Highway and Babbage Road, within the Local Centre boundary; and 
 - Secondary Road 2043, Section of Horace Street, Link Road, Killeaton Street within the Local Centre boundary.
